[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARCH-windowmgmt-windowcomposition
TITLE: 组合组件 WindowComposition
STATEMENT: >>>
WindowComposition 组合 2 个组件，1 条装配连接。
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
ARXML: /WindowMgmt/WindowComposition (composition)
contains winCtrl (/WindowMgmt/WindowControl)
contains antiPinch (/WindowMgmt/AntiPinch)
conn_pinch_cmd: WindowControl.pinchCommand => AntiPinch.pinchCommand
<<<

